{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BZQQZB7PCjXdp2yuRcL9TZ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — exec-sim-repair-verifier\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 25, 2026)\n5\t- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n6\t- Extended fallback: ICSE 2027 (Jun 23 abstract, Jun 30 paper)\n7\t- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026 (14 days from project start)\n8\t\n9\t## Core Claims (3 conditions)\n10\t\n11\t1. **Complexity-Dependent Reformulation Advantage**: Binary pass/fail classification and execution output generation (CWM-style) achieve equivalent accuracy on simple function-level code (4B: F1 diff 0.9pp), but classification scales better with model size (8B 3-seed mean accuracy gap=2.43pp; seed42: 2.81pp, cls 90.48% vs cwm 87.67%) and to repo-level complexity where CWM failure modes—token-budget exhaustion and string-value prediction errors—dominate. Zero-shot LLM-as-judge baselines (8B: 64.4%, 32B NF4: 71.7%) are far below fine-tuned 4B (88.4%), confirming fine-tuning necessity. (Validated function-level near-null + 8B scaling evidence; repo-level SWE-bench experiments in progress. Fallback: if repo-level also null, reframe to efficiency-equivalent accuracy—same F1 with 1-token vs N-token inference.)\n12\t\n13\t2. **Diagnostic Granularity At Equivalent Accuracy**: Per-test classification achieves equivalent variant-level accuracy to trajectory-level scoring (TOST equivalence test p=0.007, ±2pp margin; 5-seed pooled gap -0.40pp, 95% CI [-1.32, +0.52]) while providing actionable diagnostic information (which specific tests a patch fails). The per-test formulation gains diagnostic granularity without sacrificing accuracy—potentially enabling targeted re-repair and oracle-based test selection. (Evidence: 5-paired clustered bootstrap CI, 114 clusters, 10000 resamples. Paper must justify ±2pp margin: in code verification, 2pp variant-level difference is negligible given ICC=0.191/DEFF=3.97. Seeds 789/0 used 4-bit quantization — note in paper. Downstream re-repair experiment still needed for practical impact claim.)\n14\t\n15\t3. **Accuracy-Utility Frontier Characterization**: The effectiveness of per-test verification depends critically on test distribution characteristics. We empirically show: (a) per-test advantage concentrates in instances with multiple FAIL_TO_PASS tests (31% of SWE-bench Verified); (b) PASS_TO_PASS regression detection provides signal only when regression rate exceeds ~10%; (c) block-correlated prediction errors amplify per-test advantage through reduced effective degrees of freedom. These findings provide a practical decision framework for when per-test simulation is worth deploying.\n16\t\n17\t## Story Spine\n18\t\n19\t**Problem**: Test-time scaling for code repair requires ranking candidate patches, but verification paradigms face a granularity-cost tradeoff. Full execution costs ~$1-3 and minutes per candidate. Execution-free alternatives like SWE-RM predict trajectory-level binary correctness at low cost but provide only coarse signals that cannot distinguish between candidates failing on different test subsets.\n20\t\n21\t**Existing approaches & gaps**: Code World Models (Self-Execution Simulation, CWM) predict execution outputs but suffer from token-budget exhaustion and string-value prediction failures. SWE-RM achieves strong trajectory-level scoring but loses per-test diagnostic information. No work studies per-test binary classification as a dedicated verification formulation, or compares classification vs generation formulations for code execution simulation at controlled model sizes.\n22\t\n23\t**Our framing**: We reformulate execution simulation from an open-ended generation task (predict execution trace/output) to a closed-form classification task (predict binary pass/fail per test). On simple function-level code, both formulations achieve equivalent accuracy (~87% F1), because short execution outputs do not trigger CWM failure modes. However, on repo-level code with long execution traces and complex outputs, classification sidesteps token-budget exhaustion and string-value prediction errors, yielding a complexity-dependent advantage. We empirically ground this through (1) controlled function-level experiments establishing equivalence, (2) repo-level experiments demonstrating the complexity threshold, (3) oracle accuracy-utility frontier analysis revealing when per-test granularity helps, and (4) error complementarity analysis showing CLS/CWM have systematically opposite failure modes (CLS: miss bugs 75.5%, CWM: false alarms 83.1%), with oracle ensemble reaching 90.63%. (Downstream re-repair experiment is stretch goal; if not completed, frame as future work.)\n24\t\n25\t**Headline result template**: \"On function-level benchmarks, classification and generation verifiers achieve equivalent F1 (~87%), but classification scales better with model size (8B: +2.43pp accuracy) and on repo-level SWE-bench tasks outperforms by [Z] percentage points as CWM failure modes emerge. CLS and CWM exhibit complementary error patterns (oracle ensemble: 90.63%), suggesting formulation diversity as a verification strategy.\"\n26\t\n27\t## Venue Fit Risks\n28\t\n29\t1. **EMNLP vs SE venue**: Core concern is code repair verification, which may be perceived as SE rather than NLP. Mitigation: frame as (a) probing LLM code semantic reasoning capabilities through per-test prediction, and (b) a general NLP methodology insight about classification vs generation formulations applicable beyond code.\n30\t\n31\t2. **Negative P2P finding**: P2P regression rate ~1% means per-test is not universally better. Must present honestly as a characterization finding, not bury it. This actually strengthens the paper by showing nuanced understanding rather than overclaiming.\n32\t\n33\t3. **Function-level to repo-level gap**: Function-level results show classification ≈ generation. Repo-level extension is now CRITICAL (not optional) to demonstrate the complexity-dependent advantage. Requires SWE-bench Docker infrastructure. If repo-level also shows no advantage, paper pivots to efficiency framing (same accuracy, lower inference cost) + oracle characterization.\n34\t\n35\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Mitigations\n36\t\n37\t| Concern | Mitigation Experiment |\n38\t|---------|----------------------|\n39\t| \"Classification is trivially easier than generation -- not interesting\" | Function-level null result proves classification is NOT trivially easier; advantage is complexity-dependent, demonstrated by repo-level gap |\n40\t| \"Per-test is just trajectory-level with extra steps when T=1\" | Oracle frontier analysis shows T distribution sensitivity; honest reporting of T=1 equivalence |\n41\t| \"No practical downstream impact\" | Diagnostic re-repair experiment shows resolve rate improvement |\n42\t| \"Small-scale function-level results don't generalize\" | Repo-level SWE-bench extension (if resources allow) |\n43\t| \"CWM comparison is unfair (different output format)\" | Matched model, data, compute; discuss target asymmetry limitation |\n44\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9c8b16a8-33d8-4f2a-9bff-decd99357cc2","uuid":"9adc26a3-b74e-45e8-88a0-82db4e05489b","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:14:11.185Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073712/worst/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — exec-sim-repair-verifier\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR May 25, 2026)\n- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n- Extended fallback: ICSE 2027 (Jun 23 abstract, Jun 30 paper)\n- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026 (14 days from project start)\n\n## Core Claims (3 conditions)\n\n1. **Complexity-Dependent Reformulation Advantage**: Binary pass/fail classification and execution output generation (CWM-style) achieve equivalent accuracy on simple function-level code (4B: F1 diff 0.9pp), but classification scales better with model size (8B 3-seed mean accuracy gap=2.43pp; seed42: 2.81pp, cls 90.48% vs cwm 87.67%) and to repo-level complexity where CWM failure modes—token-budget exhaustion and string-value prediction errors—dominate. Zero-shot LLM-as-judge baselines (8B: 64.4%, 32B NF4: 71.7%) are far below fine-tuned 4B (88.4%), confirming fine-tuning necessity. (Validated function-level near-null + 8B scaling evidence; repo-level SWE-bench experiments in progress. Fallback: if repo-level also null, reframe to efficiency-equivalent accuracy—same F1 with 1-token vs N-token inference.)\n\n2. **Diagnostic Granularity At Equivalent Accuracy**: Per-test classification achieves equivalent variant-level accuracy to trajectory-level scoring (TOST equivalence test p=0.007, ±2pp margin; 5-seed pooled gap -0.40pp, 95% CI [-1.32, +0.52]) while providing actionable diagnostic information (which specific tests a patch fails). The per-test formulation gains diagnostic granularity without sacrificing accuracy—potentially enabling targeted re-repair and oracle-based test selection. (Evidence: 5-paired clustered bootstrap CI, 114 clusters, 10000 resamples. Paper must justify ±2pp margin: in code verification, 2pp variant-level difference is negligible given ICC=0.191/DEFF=3.97. Seeds 789/0 used 4-bit quantization — note in paper. Downstream re-repair experiment still needed for practical impact claim.)\n\n3. **Accuracy-Utility Frontier Characterization**: The effectiveness of per-test verification depends critically on test distribution characteristics. We empirically show: (a) per-test advantage concentrates in instances with multiple FAIL_TO_PASS tests (31% of SWE-bench Verified); (b) PASS_TO_PASS regression detection provides signal only when regression rate exceeds ~10%; (c) block-correlated prediction errors amplify per-test advantage through reduced effective degrees of freedom. These findings provide a practical decision framework for when per-test simulation is worth deploying.\n\n## Story Spine\n\n**Problem**: Test-time scaling for code repair requires ranking candidate patches, but verification paradigms face a granularity-cost tradeoff. Full execution costs ~$1-3 and minutes per candidate. Execution-free alternatives like SWE-RM predict trajectory-level binary correctness at low cost but provide only coarse signals that cannot distinguish between candidates failing on different test subsets.\n\n**Existing approaches & gaps**: Code World Models (Self-Execution Simulation, CWM) predict execution outputs but suffer from token-budget exhaustion and string-value prediction failures. SWE-RM achieves strong trajectory-level scoring but loses per-test diagnostic information. No work studies per-test binary classification as a dedicated verification formulation, or compares classification vs generation formulations for code execution simulation at controlled model sizes.\n\n**Our framing**: We reformulate execution simulation from an open-ended generation task (predict execution trace/output) to a closed-form classification task (predict binary pass/fail per test). On simple function-level code, both formulations achieve equivalent accuracy (~87% F1), because short execution outputs do not trigger CWM failure modes. However, on repo-level code with long execution traces and complex outputs, classification sidesteps token-budget exhaustion and string-value prediction errors, yielding a complexity-dependent advantage. We empirically ground this through (1) controlled function-level experiments establishing equivalence, (2) repo-level experiments demonstrating the complexity threshold, (3) oracle accuracy-utility frontier analysis revealing when per-test granularity helps, and (4) error complementarity analysis showing CLS/CWM have systematically opposite failure modes (CLS: miss bugs 75.5%, CWM: false alarms 83.1%), with oracle ensemble reaching 90.63%. (Downstream re-repair experiment is stretch goal; if not completed, frame as future work.)\n\n**Headline result template**: \"On function-level benchmarks, classification and generation verifiers achieve equivalent F1 (~87%), but classification scales better with model size (8B: +2.43pp accuracy) and on repo-level SWE-bench tasks outperforms by [Z] percentage points as CWM failure modes emerge. CLS and CWM exhibit complementary error patterns (oracle ensemble: 90.63%), suggesting formulation diversity as a verification strategy.\"\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n\n1. **EMNLP vs SE venue**: Core concern is code repair verification, which may be perceived as SE rather than NLP. Mitigation: frame as (a) probing LLM code semantic reasoning capabilities through per-test prediction, and (b) a general NLP methodology insight about classification vs generation formulations applicable beyond code.\n\n2. **Negative P2P finding**: P2P regression rate ~1% means per-test is not universally better. Must present honestly as a characterization finding, not bury it. This actually strengthens the paper by showing nuanced understanding rather than overclaiming.\n\n3. **Function-level to repo-level gap**: Function-level results show classification ≈ generation. Repo-level extension is now CRITICAL (not optional) to demonstrate the complexity-dependent advantage. Requires SWE-bench Docker infrastructure. If repo-level also shows no advantage, paper pivots to efficiency framing (same accuracy, lower inference cost) + oracle characterization.\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Mitigations\n\n| Concern | Mitigation Experiment |\n|---------|----------------------|\n| \"Classification is trivially easier than generation -- not interesting\" | Function-level null result proves classification is NOT trivially easier; advantage is complexity-dependent, demonstrated by repo-level gap |\n| \"Per-test is just trajectory-level with extra steps when T=1\" | Oracle frontier analysis shows T distribution sensitivity; honest reporting of T=1 equivalence |\n| \"No practical downstream impact\" | Diagnostic re-repair experiment shows resolve rate improvement |\n| \"Small-scale function-level results don't generalize\" | Repo-level SWE-bench extension (if resources allow) |\n| \"CWM comparison is unfair (different output format)\" | Matched model, data, compute; discuss target asymmetry limitation |\n","numLines":44,"startLine":1,"totalLines":44}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014PBPPbpyv13Ymxi4fpk19Z","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Diagnostic Re-repair Experiment\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"给修复代理提供per-test failure predictions vs 无per-test信息， 在200个instances上比较resolve rate。使用SWE-agent框架， classification模型提供per-test诊断。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"baseline_resolve_rate_pct\": 29.0,\n7\t      \"with_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pct\": 29.5,\n8\t      \"resolve_rate_gain_pp\": 0.5,\n9\t      \"gain_significant_at_005\": false,\n10\t      \"mcnemar_p_value\": 0.72,\n11\t      \"instances_helped_by_diagnostic\": 5,\n12\t      \"instances_hurt_by_diagnostic\": 4,\n13\t      \"net_helped\": 1,\n14\t      \"diagnostic_precision_on_helped\": 0.8,\n15\t      \"diagnostic_precision_on_hurt\": 0.6,\n16\t      \"oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pct\": 33.5,\n17\t      \"oracle_vs_baseline_gain_pp\": 4.5,\n18\t      \"oracle_vs_predicted_gap_pp\": 4.0,\n19\t      \"time_cost_per_instance_baseline_min\": 8.2,\n20\t      \"time_cost_per_instance_diagnostic_min\": 8.5,\n21\t      \"T1_instances_in_200\": 137,\n22\t      \"T1_gain_pp\": 0.0,\n23\t      \"T2plus_instances_in_200\": 63,\n24\t      \"T2plus_gain_pp\": 1.6\n25\t    },\n26\t    \"tables\": [\n27\t      {\n28\t        \"caption\": \"Diagnostic re-repair: predicted vs oracle per-test information\",\n29\t        \"columns\": [\n30\t          \"Condition\",\n31\t          \"Resolve Rate (%)\",\n32\t          \"Δ vs Baseline (pp)\",\n33\t          \"p-value\"\n34\t        ],\n35\t        \"rows\": [\n36\t          [\n37\t            \"No diagnostic (baseline)\",\n38\t            29.0,\n39\t            \"—\",\n40\t            \"—\"\n41\t          ],\n42\t          [\n43\t            \"Predicted per-test diagnostic\",\n44\t            29.5,\n45\t            \"+0.5\",\n46\t            \"0.72\"\n47\t          ],\n48\t          [\n49\t            \"Oracle per-test (ceiling)\",\n50\t            33.5,\n51\t            \"+4.5\",\n52\t            \"0.02\"\n53\t          ]\n54\t        ]\n55\t      },\n56\t      {\n57\t        \"caption\": \"Re-repair gain stratified by F2P test count\",\n58\t        \"columns\": [\n59\t          \"T bucket\",\n60\t          \"N instances\",\n61\t          \"Baseline resolve %\",\n62\t          \"Diagnostic resolve %\",\n63\t          \"Δ pp\"\n64\t        ],\n65\t        \"rows\": [\n66\t          [\n67\t            \"T=1\",\n68\t            137,\n69\t            30.7,\n70\t            30.7,\n71\t            \"0.0\"\n72\t          ],\n73\t          [\n74\t            \"T=2\",\n75\t            40,\n76\t            25.0,\n77\t            27.5,\n78\t            \"+2.5\"\n79\t          ],\n80\t          [\n81\t            \"T≥3\",\n82\t            23,\n83\t            21.7,\n84\t            21.7,\n85\t            \"0.0\"\n86\t          ],\n87\t          [\n88\t            \"All\",\n89\t            200,\n90\t            29.0,\n91\t            29.5,\n92\t            \"+0.5\"\n93\t          ]\n94\t        ]\n95\t      }\n96\t    ],\n97\t    \"figures\": [],\n98\t    \"analysis\": \"Oracle ceiling（+4.5pp）与predicted gain（+0.5pp）之间的巨大gap（4.0pp） 证实了worst档的核心论断：per-test诊断的价值是真实的但目前prediction quality 不足以释放这个价值。在pivot论文中，这成为\\\"future work\\\"的明确方向—— 提升per-test prediction precision到>90%可能释放更多oracle ceiling。 但当前实验结论是negative：predicted diagnostics do not significantly  improve repair outcomes。\\n\\n\\nWorst档假设\\\"无downstream re-repair实验，per-test diagnostic value仅为theoretical  argument\\\"。即使勉强跑完实验，gain仅+0.5pp（29.5% vs 29.0%），原因： (1) 200个instances中~137个(68.7%)是T=1，per-test信息与trajectory-level数学等价， 诊断信号零增益； (2) 剩余63个T≥2 instances中，per-test prediction precision ~80%意味着每5个predicted-fail 中约1个是误报——修复代理基于错误诊断做了无效修复尝试（4个instances被误导）； (3) 仅5个instances中诊断真正帮助定位了具体失败测试并引导修复成功——但这些大多是 T=2且两个测试failure mode清晰分离的\\\"easy\\\"案例； (4) Oracle上界（33.5%）显示per-test信息在完美条件下有价值（+4.5pp），但predicted  diagnostic仅能实现11%的oracle ceiling（0.5/4.5）； (5) McNemar p=0.72，远不显著——200个instances的power不足以检测<1pp的差异。 这个结果在worst档叙事中将Claim 2完全降级为theoretical argument。\\n\"\n99\t  },\n100\t  {\n101\t    \"name\": \"SWE-bench Per-Test Dataset Construction\",\n102\t    \"description\": \"Docker重新评估SWE-bench Verified patches，提取per-test labels。 构建SWE-bench-PerTest数据集（500 instances × 16 candidates）。\\n\",\n103\t    \"results\": {\n104\t      \"total_instances_attempted\": 500,\n105\t      \"successful_evaluations\": 458,\n106\t      \"failed_docker_builds\": 27,\n107\t      \"timeout_evaluations\": 15,\n108\t      \"total_candidate_test_pairs\": 115872,\n109\t      \"avg_tests_per_instance\": 15.8,\n110\t      \"avg_f2p_tests_per_instance\": 2.1,\n111\t      \"median_f2p_tests\": 1,\n112\t      \"pct_T1_instances\": 71.2,\n113\t      \"pct_T2_instances\": 16.8,\n114\t      \"pct_T3plus_instances\": 12.0,\n115\t      \"avg_p2p_tests_per_instance\": 13.7,\n116\t      \"pass_rate_overall\": 0.73,\n117\t      \"fail_rate_overall\": 0.27,\n118\t      \"p2p_regression_rate\": 0.8,\n119\t      \"construction_time_hours\": 24,\n120\t      \"gold_patch_all_pass_rate\": 0.96,\n121\t      \"candidate_diversity_unique_test_signatures\": 312\n122\t    },\n123\t    \"tables\": [\n124\t      {\n125\t        \"caption\": \"SWE-bench-PerTest dataset statistics\",\n126\t        \"columns\": [\n127\t          \"Metric\",\n128\t          \"Value\"\n129\t        ],\n130\t        \"rows\": [\n131\t          [\n132\t            \"Instances (successful)\",\n133\t            458\n134\t          ],\n135\t          [\n136\t            \"Candidates per instance (mean)\",\n137\t            16\n138\t          ],\n139\t          [\n140\t            \"Total (code, test) pairs\",\n141\t            \"115,872\"\n142\t          ],\n143\t          [\n144\t            \"F2P tests per instance (mean / median)\",\n145\t            \"2.1 / 1\"\n146\t          ],\n147\t          [\n148\t            \"P2P tests per instance (mean)\",\n149\t            13.7\n150\t          ],\n151\t          [\n152\t            \"T=1 instances\",\n153\t            \"71.2%\"\n154\t          ],\n155\t          [\n156\t            \"T≥2 instances\",\n157\t            \"28.8%\"\n158\t          ],\n159\t          [\n160\t            \"Overall pass rate\",\n161\t            \"73%\"\n162\t          ],\n163\t          [\n164\t            \"P2P regression rate\",\n165\t            \"0.8%\"\n166\t          ]\n167\t        ]\n168\t      },\n169\t      {\n170\t        \"caption\": \"F2P test count distribution\",\n171\t        \"columns\": [\n172\t          \"T\",\n173\t          \"% Instances\",\n174\t          \"Cumulative %\"\n175\t        ],\n176\t        \"rows\": [\n177\t          [\n178\t            1,\n179\t            71.2,\n180\t            71.2\n181\t          ],\n182\t          [\n183\t            2,\n184\t            16.8,\n185\t            88.0\n186\t          ],\n187\t          [\n188\t            3,\n189\t            5.2,\n190\t            93.2\n191\t          ],\n192\t          [\n193\t            \"4-5\",\n194\t            3.8,\n195\t            97.0\n196\t          ],\n197\t          [\n198\t            \"6+\",\n199\t            3.0,\n200\t            100.0\n201\t          ]\n202\t        ]\n203\t      }\n204\t    ],\n205\t    \"figures\": [],\n206\t    \"analysis\": \"数据集本身作为resource contribution有独立价值。但worst档下的分布特征 系统性地削弱per-test方法的pitch：T=1主导+低regression rate意味着 大多数instances中per-test粒度退化为trajectory-level等价。 73%的pass rate使得\\\"预测fail\\\"成为稀有事件检测问题，precision-recall tradeoff更不利。论文需诚实报告这些分布特征并作为characterization贡献。\\n\\n\\n数据集构建是工程任务，worst档不影响技术成功率。但分布特征在worst档下 对论文叙事不利： (1) T=1占71.2%（高于function-level oracle sim的68.7%），意味着repo-level 数据中per-test粒度的理论优势更稀薄——超过7成instances只有1个F2P测试； (2) median F2P=1确认了T=1 mode的dominance； (3) P2P regression rate仅0.8%（远低于oracle sim中reg≥10%的threshold）， 意味着PASS_TO_PASS测试几乎不提供额外信号——patch极少破坏已通过的测试； (4) overall pass rate 73%意味着class imbalance加剧（vs function-level ~50:50）， majority baseline就有73%，fine-tuned模型需要beat这个high baseline； (5) 42/500 instances因Docker build failure或timeout丢失（8.4%）， 可能引入selection bias——失败的往往是环境最复杂的instances，恰恰是 per-test可能最有价值的instances。\\n\"\n207\t  },\n208\t  {\n209\t    \"name\": \"DeepSeek-Coder CLS Function-Level\",\n210\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32) 在function-level 数据上训练classification (pass/fail)。验证CLS formulation是否 architecture-independent。\\n\",\n211\t    \"results\": {\n212\t      \"overall_accuracy\": 88.73,\n213\t      \"pass_f1\": 88.85,\n214\t      \"fail_f1\": 88.6,\n215\t      \"pass_precision\": 90.5,\n216\t      \"pass_recall\": 87.25,\n217\t      \"fail_precision\": 87.0,\n218\t      \"fail_recall\": 90.3,\n219\t      \"train_loss\": 0.21,\n220\t      \"eval_loss\": 0.075,\n221\t      \"train_runtime_sec\": 4800,\n222\t      \"unparseable\": 0,\n223\t      \"cls_vs_cwm_gap_deepseek_pp\": 0.52,\n224\t      \"cls_vs_cwm_gap_qwen4b_pp\": 1.25,\n225\t      \"cls_vs_cwm_gap_qwen8b_pp\": 2.43,\n226\t      \"gap_trend_with_size\": \"non-monotonic\"\n227\t    },\n228\t    \"tables\": [\n229\t      {\n230\t        \"caption\": \"Cross-architecture CLS vs CWM comparison (function-level)\",\n231\t        \"columns\": [\n232\t          \"Architecture\",\n233\t          \"Size\",\n234\t          \"CLS Acc %\",\n235\t          \"CWM Acc %\",\n236\t          \"Gap (pp)\"\n237\t        ],\n238\t        \"rows\": [\n239\t          [\n240\t            \"Qwen3\",\n241\t            \"4B\",\n242\t            88.43,\n243\t            87.19,\n244\t            \"+1.25\"\n245\t          ],\n246\t          [\n247\t            \"DeepSeek-Coder\",\n248\t            \"6.7B\",\n249\t            88.73,\n250\t            88.21,\n251\t            \"+0.52\"\n252\t          ],\n253\t          [\n254\t            \"Qwen3\",\n255\t            \"8B\",\n256\t            89.4,\n257\t            86.96,\n258\t            \"+2.43\"\n259\t          ]\n260\t        ]\n261\t      }\n262\t    ],\n263\t    \"figures\": [],\n264\t    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek的小gap直接削弱了\\\"classification scales better with model size\\\"的claim。 在worst档pivot论文中，这变为characterization finding：\\\"CLS-CWM gap depends on  base model's code generation capability, not just formulation\\\"。 这实际上加强了complementarity角度——如果gap是architecture-dependent， 那么在不同模型上CLS和CWM的failure modes更可能不同，ensemble更有价值。\\n\\n\\nWorst档核心假设：\\\"DeepSeek实验显示不同pattern，削弱architecture-independence claim\\\"。 DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B是code-specialized模型（vs Qwen3通用模型），其预训练数据 包含大量代码执行trace，这使得CWM (generation)任务对DeepSeek相对更容易： (1) DeepSeek-CLS达到88.73%，介于Qwen-4B(88.43%)和Qwen-8B(89.40%)之间， 符合6.7B参数量的预期——这证明CLS在不同架构上表现一致； (2) 但CLS vs CWM gap仅0.52pp（远低于Qwen-4B的1.25pp和Qwen-8B的2.43pp）， 因为DeepSeek-Coder的code generation能力使CWM受益更多—— CWM在DeepSeek上达到~88.2%（vs Qwen-4B的87.19%）； (3) Gap trend变为non-monotonic：Qwen-4B 1.25pp → DeepSeek-6.7B 0.52pp →  Qwen-8B 2.43pp，无法claim \\\"gap随model size单调增长\\\"； (4) 这意味着CLS vs CWM gap不是architecture-independent的，而是依赖于 base model的code generation pretraining quality——pretraining越强的模型 CWM受益越多，gap越小。 Reviewer会据此质疑\\\"formulation advantage\\\"是否只是Qwen-specific artifact。\\n\"\n265\t  },\n266\t  {\n267\t    \"name\": \"DeepSeek-Coder CWM Function-Level (seed default)\",\n268\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA CWM generation baseline， function-level。已完成训练（eval_loss=0.04292），待测试集评估。\\n\",\n269\t    \"results\": {\n270\t      \"overall_accuracy\": 88.21,\n271\t      \"pass_f1\": 88.1,\n272\t      \"fail_f1\": 88.32,\n273\t      \"pass_precision\": 91.2,\n274\t      \"pass_recall\": 85.2,\n275\t      \"fail_precision\": 85.4,\n276\t      \"fail_recall\": 91.4,\n277\t      \"exact_match_rate\": 85.5,\n278\t      \"train_loss_final\": 0.0986,\n279\t      \"eval_loss\": 0.04292,\n280\t      \"train_runtime_sec\": 5215,\n281\t      \"unparseable\": 0,\n282\t      \"vs_qwen4b_cwm_gap_pp\": 0.7,\n283\t      \"vs_qwen8b_cwm_gap_pp\": 0.54\n284\t    },\n285\t    \"tables\": [\n286\t      {\n287\t        \"caption\": \"CWM generation accuracy across architectures\",\n288\t        \"columns\": [\n289\t          \"Architecture\",\n290\t          \"Size\",\n291\t          \"CWM Acc %\",\n292\t          \"Exact Match %\",\n293\t          \"Eval Loss\"\n294\t        ],\n295\t        \"rows\": [\n296\t          [\n297\t            \"Qwen3\",\n298\t            \"4B\",\n299\t            87.51,\n300\t            84.02,\n301\t            0.064\n302\t          ],\n303\t          [\n304\t            \"DeepSeek-Coder\",\n305\t            \"6.7B\",\n306\t            88.21,\n307\t            85.5,\n308\t            0.043\n309\t          ],\n310\t          [\n311\t            \"Qwen3\",\n312\t            \"8B\",\n313\t            87.67,\n314\t            84.39,\n315\t            0.055\n316\t          ]\n317\t        ]\n318\t      }\n319\t    ],\n320\t    \"figures\": [],\n321\t    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek-CWM的优异表现是worst档的关键evidence：如果一个code-specialized 6.7B模型的CWM能match其CLS，那么CWM的\\\"difficulty\\\"不是generation task 的inherent property，而是base model capability的function。 论文pivot：不再claim \\\"generation is harder than classification\\\"， 改为\\\"the relative difficulty depends on the model's generation capability\\\"。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek-CWM在function-level达到88.21%，高于Qwen-4B CWM(87.51%)和 Qwen-8B CWM(87.67%)。原因： (1) DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B的eval_loss(0.043)显著低于Qwen-4B CWM(0.064)和 Qwen-8B CWM(0.055)，说明code-specialized pretraining让generation target 更容易拟合； (2) Exact match rate 85.5%（vs Qwen-4B的84.02%），更多predictions能 完美复现execution output字面值； (3) 这些output精确度的提升直接转化为分类准确率的提升——CWM的accuracy 上限受限于exact match quality； (4) 但与DeepSeek-CLS(88.73%)相比gap仅0.52pp，确认了在code-specialized 模型上classification advantage最小化。 Worst档叙事：DeepSeek的CWM强表现证明\\\"CWM failure modes at function-level\\\" 不是因为generation inherently harder，而是因为base model的generation  capability不同。\\n\"\n322\t  },\n323\t  {\n324\t    \"name\": \"DeepSeek-Coder CWM Function-Level seed=123\",\n325\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B CWM function-level with seed=123， 用于multi-seed validation of DeepSeek CWM results。\\n\",\n326\t    \"results\": {\n327\t      \"overall_accuracy\": 87.88,\n328\t      \"pass_f1\": 87.75,\n329\t      \"fail_f1\": 88.0,\n330\t      \"exact_match_rate\": 85.1,\n331\t      \"eval_loss\": 0.0445,\n332\t      \"train_runtime_sec\": 5300,\n333\t      \"unparseable\": 0,\n334\t      \"seed_default_accuracy\": 88.21,\n335\t      \"seed_123_accuracy\": 87.88,\n336\t      \"seed_gap_pp\": 0.33,\n337\t      \"deepseek_cwm_mean_2seed\": 88.05,\n338\t      \"deepseek_cwm_std_2seed\": 0.23\n339\t    },\n340\t    \"tables\": [\n341\t      {\n342\t        \"caption\": \"DeepSeek CWM multi-seed results (function-level)\",\n343\t        \"columns\": [\n344\t          \"Seed\",\n345\t          \"Accuracy %\",\n346\t          \"Exact Match %\",\n347\t          \"Eval Loss\"\n348\t        ],\n349\t        \"rows\": [\n350\t          [\n351\t            \"default\",\n352\t            88.21,\n353\t            85.5,\n354\t            0.0429\n355\t          ],\n356\t          [\n357\t            \"123\",\n358\t            87.88,\n359\t            85.1,\n360\t            0.0445\n361\t          ],\n362\t          [\n363\t            \"Mean±Std\",\n364\t            \"88.05±0.23\",\n365\t            \"85.30±0.28\",\n366\t            \"0.0437±0.001\"\n367\t          ]\n368\t        ]\n369\t      }\n370\t    ],\n371\t    \"figures\": [],\n372\t    \"analysis\": \"两个seed结果一致但sample size不足。Worst档下reviewer会说 \\\"2 seeds is anecdotal, not statistical\\\"，要求至少3个seed。 如果deadline前无法补跑，DeepSeek comparison只能作为supplementary observation而非formal claim。\\n\\n\\nSeed=123与default seed的差异仅0.33pp（87.88% vs 88.21%），在正常 seed variance范围内（std ~0.23pp，低于Qwen-4B CWM的seed std ~0.35pp）。 DeepSeek-Coder的更低variance可能因为：(1) code-specialized pretraining提供了 更稳定的初始化，LoRA微调的随机性影响更小；(2) 6.7B参数量比4B有更多冗余， 对随机seed的敏感度更低。 两个seed的mean(88.05%)确认DeepSeek-CWM稳定优于Qwen-4B CWM(87.19%)， 但仅2个seed不足以做严格的statistical comparison。 Worst档影响：reviewer可能要求3-5个seed才接受architecture comparison claim， 仅2个seed被视为insufficient evidence。\\n\"\n373\t  },\n374\t  {\n375\t    \"name\": \"DeepSeek-Coder CLS Repo-Level\",\n376\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA classification在repo-level SWE-bench数据上训练。验证repo-level CLS是否generalize across architectures。\\n\",\n377\t    \"results\": {\n378\t      \"best_checkpoint_accuracy\": 78.15,\n379\t      \"best_checkpoint_f1_macro\": 69.82,\n380\t      \"best_checkpoint_fail_f1\": 55.3,\n381\t      \"best_checkpoint_pass_f1\": 84.34,\n382\t      \"fail_precision\": 72.5,\n383\t      \"fail_recall\": 44.6,\n384\t      \"pass_precision\": 79.8,\n385\t      \"pass_recall\": 89.5,\n386\t      \"unparseable_pct\": 1.8,\n387\t      \"majority_baseline\": 72.96,\n388\t      \"gap_vs_majority_pp\": 5.19,\n389\t      \"vs_qwen4b_repo_cls_accuracy_diff_pp\": -4.2,\n390\t      \"vs_qwen8b_repo_cls_accuracy_diff_pp\": -5.37,\n391\t      \"overfitting_epoch\": 2,\n392\t      \"eval_loss_trend\": \"U-shaped, minimum at step 400-600\",\n393\t      \"train_time_sec\": 18000\n394\t    },\n395\t    \"tables\": [\n396\t      {\n397\t        \"caption\": \"Repo-level CLS across architectures\",\n398\t        \"columns\": [\n399\t          \"Architecture\",\n400\t          \"Size\",\n401\t          \"Accuracy %\",\n402\t          \"Fail F1 %\",\n403\t          \"Gap vs Majority (pp)\"\n404\t        ],\n405\t        \"rows\": [\n406\t          [\n407\t            \"Qwen3\",\n408\t            \"4B\",\n409\t            82.35,\n410\t            60.87,\n411\t            \"+9.39\"\n412\t          ],\n413\t          [\n414\t            \"DeepSeek-Coder\",\n415\t            \"6.7B\",\n416\t            78.15,\n417\t            55.3,\n418\t            \"+5.19\"\n419\t          ],\n420\t          [\n421\t            \"Qwen3\",\n422\t            \"8B\",\n423\t            83.52,\n424\t            65.85,\n425\t            \"+10.56\"\n426\t          ]\n427\t        ]\n428\t      },\n429\t      {\n430\t        \"caption\": \"Function-to-repo performance drop by architecture\",\n431\t        \"columns\": [\n432\t          \"Architecture\",\n433\t          \"Func Acc %\",\n434\t          \"Repo Acc %\",\n435\t          \"Drop (pp)\"\n436\t        ],\n437\t        \"rows\": [\n438\t          [\n439\t            \"Qwen3-4B\",\n440\t            88.43,\n441\t            82.35,\n442\t            \"-6.08\"\n443\t          ],\n444\t          [\n445\t            \"DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n446\t            88.73,\n447\t            78.15,\n448\t            \"-10.58\"\n449\t          ],\n450\t          [\n451\t            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n452\t            89.4,\n453\t            83.52,\n454\t            \"-5.88\"\n455\t          ]\n456\t        ]\n457\t      }\n458\t    ],\n459\t    \"figures\": [],\n460\t    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek在repo-level的相对劣势是worst档最damaging的finding之一。 它证明：(a) CLS formulation的effectiveness是architecture-dependent； (b) code-specialized pretraining不自动转化为repo-level verification能力； (c) 不同架构在function-level vs repo-level的ranking反转（DeepSeek func >  Qwen-4B func, 但DeepSeek repo < Qwen-4B repo）。 论文必须降级architecture comparison为\\\"preliminary observation\\\"， 承认需要更多架构（CodeLlama, StarCoder等）才能draw conclusions。\\n\\n\\nWorst档核心假设：\\\"Repo-level CLS accuracy <80%或seed间variance>5pp\\\"。 DeepSeek-CLS-repo达到78.15%（低于Qwen-4B的82.35%和Qwen-8B的83.52%）， 原因： (1) DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B虽然是code-specialized模型，但其pretraining 偏向code generation而非code understanding/classification——repo-level 的pass/fail判断需要理解长上下文中的语义一致性，这是code understanding任务； (2) Repo-level input长度（5120-8192 tokens）对6.7B模型的attention capacity 构成挑战——DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B的有效context window可能不如Qwen3-8B； (3) LoRA rank=16可能对6.7B模型insufficient——Qwen实验中同样rank=16， 但Qwen3架构可能更LoRA-friendly（GQA vs MHA差异）； (4) 78.15%仅比majority baseline(73%)高5pp，在worst档范围[75,80]中部， reviewer会质疑这个marginal improvement是否justify the fine-tuning cost； (5) fail_f1仅55.30%，说明模型在识别failing tests方面表现差——这正是 per-test verification最需要的能力。\\n关键影响：DeepSeek在repo-level表现更差（vs function-level的88.73%）， drop幅度10.58pp（vs Qwen-4B的5.72pp from 88.43→82.35），说明 DeepSeek在domain transfer (func→repo) 上比Qwen更脆弱。 这进一步复杂化了architecture comparison story——不同架构在不同 complexity level上的ranking不同。\\n\"\n461\t  },\n462\t  {\n463\t    \"name\": \"Repo-Level CLS Multi-Seed Validation\",\n464\t    \"description\": \"Repo-level CLS的multi-seed validation（seed42已完成，预测seed123/456结果）。 验证repo-level结果的稳定性。\\n\",\n465\t    \"results\": {\n466\t      \"seed42_accuracy\": 82.35,\n467\t      \"seed42_fail_f1\": 60.87,\n468\t      \"seed123_accuracy\": 77.8,\n469\t      \"seed123_fail_f1\": 53.2,\n470\t      \"seed456_accuracy\": 79.5,\n471\t      \"seed456_fail_f1\": 57.4,\n472\t      \"multiseed_mean_accuracy\": 79.88,\n473\t      \"multiseed_std_accuracy\": 2.32,\n474\t      \"multiseed_mean_fail_f1\": 57.16,\n475\t      \"multiseed_std_fail_f1\": 3.87,\n476\t      \"seed_range_accuracy_pp\": 4.55,\n477\t      \"seed42_vs_mean_diff_pp\": 2.47,\n478\t      \"cls_vs_cwm_repo_gap_pp\": \"undefined (CWM repo failed)\",\n479\t      \"reviewer_concern_seed_variance\": true\n480\t    },\n481\t    \"tables\": [\n482\t      {\n483\t        \"caption\": \"Repo-level CLS multi-seed results (Qwen3-4B)\",\n484\t        \"columns\": [\n485\t          \"Seed\",\n486\t          \"Accuracy %\",\n487\t          \"Fail F1 %\",\n488\t          \"Pass F1 %\",\n489\t          \"Unparseable %\"\n490\t        ],\n491\t        \"rows\": [\n492\t          [\n493\t            42,\n494\t            82.35,\n495\t            60.87,\n496\t            89.59,\n497\t            0.0\n498\t          ],\n499\t          [\n500\t            123,\n501\t            77.8,\n502\t            53.2,\n503\t            85.1,\n504\t            1.5\n505\t          ],\n506\t          [\n507\t            456,\n508\t            79.5,\n509\t            57.4,\n510\t            87.3,\n511\t            0.8\n512\t          ],\n513\t          [\n514\t            \"Mean±Std\",\n515\t            \"79.88±2.32\",\n516\t            \"57.16±3.87\",\n517\t            \"87.33±2.25\",\n518\t            \"0.77±0.75\"\n519\t          ]\n520\t        ]\n521\t      }\n522\t    ],\n523\t    \"figures\": [],\n524\t    \"analysis\": \"Multi-seed mean 79.88%低于majority baseline+10pp threshold that reviewers typically expect for \\\"meaningful\\\" improvement。Seed42的82.35%看起来decent 但它是3个seed中最好的——如果论文只报告seed42，reviewer会质疑cherry-picking。 报告3-seed mean则只有79.88%，不足以支撑strong repo-level claim。 Fail_f1的高variance（std 3.87pp）意味着per-test diagnostic在不同 random runs间不稳定——这与function-level（fail_f1 std ~0.92pp）形成鲜明对比。 在worst档pivot中，repo-level results降级为\\\"preliminary\\\"， 承认需要更多compute和hyperparameter tuning。\\n\\n\\nWorst档核心指标：repo_cls_accuracy_multiseed在[75,80]，repo_cls_fail_f1在[50,62]。 Seed42的82.35%是cherry-picked best seed： (1) Seed123在repo-level的home server上已有partial results——cls4b-seed123-ckpt800 val5120准确率87.92%（validation），但test准确率仅75.33%（大幅val-test gap， 9784 samples），说明该seed严重过拟合； (2) Seed456预计79.50%——居中但低于seed42，因为不同random initialization 在repo-level的高维parameter space中找到不同local minima； (3) Multi-seed mean 79.88%落入worst档[75,80]范围，std 2.32pp表示 moderate但不negligible的variance； (4) Seed42比mean高2.47pp，reviewer会质疑是否report了best seed； (5) Fail_f1 mean仅57.16%（std 3.87pp），说明模型对failing tests的识别 在不同seed间极不稳定——这是diagnostic value的致命缺陷； (6) CWM repo-level实验全部failed（unparseable 53-93%），无法计算cls-cwm gap， reviewer会归因于experimental design而非formulation差异。\\n\"\n525\t  },\n526\t  {\n527\t    \"name\": \"Repo-Level CWM Revisited (Reviewer Challenge)\",\n528\t    \"description\": \"预测reviewer对repo-level CWM失败的质疑及重做实验的结果。 Reviewer会认为CWM failure是max_new_tokens/prompt设计导致， 要求增大token budget重做。\\n\",\n529\t    \"results\": {\n530\t      \"cwm_v10_accuracy\": 69.91,\n531\t      \"cwm_v10_unparseable_pct\": 93.0,\n532\t      \"cwm_v10_with_tok512_accuracy\": 72.5,\n533\t      \"cwm_v10_with_tok512_unparseable_pct\": 45.0,\n534\t      \"cwm_v10_with_tok1024_accuracy\": 74.8,\n535\t      \"cwm_v10_with_tok1024_unparseable_pct\": 28.0,\n536\t      \"cwm_v10_with_tok2048_accuracy\": 75.5,\n537\t      \"cwm_v10_with_tok2048_unparseable_pct\": 18.0,\n538\t      \"cwm_tok2048_vs_cls_gap_pp\": -4.38,\n539\t      \"cwm_tok2048_inference_cost_ratio\": 35.0,\n540\t      \"reviewer_satisfied\": false,\n541\t      \"rebuttal_risk\": \"high\"\n542\t    },\n543\t    \"tables\": [\n544\t      {\n545\t        \"caption\": \"Repo-level CWM accuracy vs token budget (Qwen3-4B)\",\n546\t        \"columns\": [\n547\t          \"max_new_tokens\",\n548\t          \"Accuracy %\",\n549\t          \"Unparseable %\",\n550\t          \"Δ vs CLS mean (pp)\",\n551\t          \"Inference Cost (×)\"\n552\t        ],\n553\t        \"rows\": [\n554\t          [\n555\t            64,\n556\t            69.91,\n557\t            93.0,\n558\t            \"-9.97\",\n559\t            \"1.5×\"\n560\t          ],\n561\t          [\n562\t            512,\n563\t            72.5,\n564\t            45.0,\n565\t            \"-7.38\",\n566\t            \"8×\"\n567\t          ],\n568\t          [\n569\t            1024,\n570\t            74.8,\n571\t            28.0,\n572\t            \"-5.08\",\n573\t            \"16×\"\n574\t          ],\n575\t          [\n576\t            2048,\n577\t            75.5,\n578\t            18.0,\n579\t            \"-4.38\",\n580\t            \"35×\"\n581\t          ],\n582\t          [\n583\t            \"CLS (1 token)\",\n584\t            79.88,\n585\t            0.0,\n586\t            \"—\",\n587\t            \"1×\"\n588\t          ]\n589\t        ]\n590\t      }\n591\t    ],\n592\t    \"figures\": [],\n593\t    \"analysis\": \"Token budget sweep是worst档rebuttal的核心风险。即使CWM-tok2048的accuracy 仍低于CLS，4.38pp gap在reviewer眼中可能\\\"来自其他confounds而非formulation\\\"。 在pivot论文中，这变为efficiency-accuracy tradeoff analysis： CLS用1-token达到CWM 2048-token的更高accuracy——这是genuine contribution 但需要careful framing避免being dismissed as \\\"unfair comparison\\\"。\\n\\n\\nWorst档假设：\\\"Reviewer将CWM repo-level failure归因于max_new_tokens/prompt设计， 要求重做实验\\\"。实际已有的cwm-v10结果：accuracy 69.91%但93%unparseable。 Reviewer的合理质疑： (1) max_new_tokens=64（D047记录）导致93% unparseable——这是obvious  experimental error，不是formulation的inherent limitation； (2) 增大token budget到512后unparseable降至~45%，accuracy升至72.50%—— 说明CWM failure是token budget artifact而非fundamental； (3) 进一步增至1024 (28% unparseable, 74.80%) 和2048 (18%, 75.50%)， CWM持续改善，但改善速度递减（diminishing returns）； (4) 即使tok=2048，CWM仍低于CLS mean(79.88%) 约4.38pp——但这个gap 可能是因为CWM还可以进一步优化（prompt format、更大token budget、 post-processing）； (5) Reviewer会说：\\\"You set up CWM to fail by limiting tokens.  A fair comparison needs CWM with sufficient token budget.\\\"—— 即使我们argue CWM的高token cost是formulation的inherent cost， reviewer关心的是accuracy comparison是否fair，not cost。\\nCWM-tok2048的35x inference cost是efficiency argument的支撑， 但worst档下reviewer可能不买账：\\\"efficiency without accuracy parity  is not a contribution\\\"。\\n\"\n594\t  },\n595\t  {\n596\t    \"name\": \"Error Complementarity Deep Analysis\",\n597\t    \"description\": \"CLS和CWM在matched seeds上的error overlap分析。 已有4B seed42数据（oracle 90.63%），预测8B和multi-seed结果。\\n\",\n598\t    \"results\": {\n599\t      \"oracle_ensemble_4b_seed42\": 90.63,\n600\t      \"oracle_ensemble_4b_5seed_mean\": 90.25,\n601\t      \"oracle_ensemble_8b_seed42\": 93.1,\n602\t      \"oracle_ensemble_8b_3seed_mean\": 92.5,\n603\t      \"cls_only_correct_pct_4b\": 3.12,\n604\t      \"cwm_only_correct_pct_4b\": 2.8,\n605\t      \"both_wrong_pct_4b\": 9.37,\n606\t      \"cls_only_correct_pct_8b\": 4.5,\n607\t      \"cwm_only_correct_pct_8b\": 2.1,\n608\t      \"both_wrong_pct_8b\": 4.4,\n609\t      \"cls_fn_dominance_pct\": 75.5,\n610\t      \"cwm_fp_dominance_pct\": 83.1,\n611\t      \"kappa_predictions_4b\": 0.88,\n612\t      \"kappa_correctness_4b\": 0.73,\n613\t      \"kappa_predictions_8b\": 0.82,\n614\t      \"kappa_correctness_8b\": 0.65,\n615\t      \"practical_ensemble_accuracy_4b\": 88.9,\n616\t      \"practical_ensemble_accuracy_8b\": 91.2,\n617\t      \"ensemble_vs_oracle_gap_4b_pp\": 1.73,\n618\t      \"ensemble_vs_oracle_gap_8b_pp\": 1.9\n619\t    },\n620\t    \"tables\": [\n621\t      {\n622\t        \"caption\": \"Error overlap analysis (function-level, matched seeds)\",\n623\t        \"columns\": [\n624\t          \"Category\",\n625\t          \"4B seed42 (%)\",\n626\t          \"4B 5-seed mean (%)\",\n627\t          \"8B 3-seed mean (%)\"\n628\t        ],\n629\t        \"rows\": [\n630\t          [\n631\t            \"Both correct\",\n632\t            84.71,\n633\t            84.35,\n634\t            89.0\n635\t          ],\n636\t          [\n637\t            \"CLS-only correct\",\n638\t            3.12,\n639\t            2.95,\n640\t            4.5\n641\t          ],\n642\t          [\n643\t            \"CWM-only correct\",\n644\t            2.8,\n645\t            2.65,\n646\t            2.1\n647\t          ],\n648\t          [\n649\t            \"Both wrong\",\n650\t            9.37,\n651\t            10.05,\n652\t            4.4\n653\t          ],\n654\t          [\n655\t            \"Oracle ensemble\",\n656\t            90.63,\n657\t            90.25,\n658\t            93.1\n659\t          ]\n660\t        ]\n661\t      },\n662\t      {\n663\t        \"caption\": \"Error type asymmetry (CLS vs CWM)\",\n664\t        \"columns\": [\n665\t          \"Error Type\",\n666\t          \"CLS (%)\",\n667\t          \"CWM (%)\"\n668\t        ],\n669\t        \"rows\": [\n670\t          [\n671\t            \"False Negative (miss bug)\",\n672\t            75.5,\n673\t            16.9\n674\t          ],\n675\t          [\n676\t            \"False Positive (false alarm)\",\n677\t            24.5,\n678\t            83.1\n679\t          ]\n680\t        ]\n681\t      }\n682\t    ],\n683\t    \"figures\": [],\n684\t    \"analysis\": \"Error complementarity在worst档下是最defensible的contribution。 它不依赖于CLS > CWM的claim——即使CLS ≈ CWM，它们fail on different  instances in predictable ways (CLS: conservative → miss bugs;  CWM: noisy generation → false alarms)。Oracle ensemble 90.63% 作为upper bound motivates future work on learned ensemble strategies。 在pivot论文中，这可以成为Section 5: \\\"Complementary Failure Modes  as a Verification Strategy\\\"的核心内容。\\n\\n\\nError complementarity是worst档pivot叙事的三大支柱之一。 4B seed42的已有数据：oracle 90.63%（both correct 84.71%, CLS-only 3.12%,  CWM-only 2.80%, both wrong 9.37%）。\\nWorst档下的补充预测： (1) 4B 5-seed mean oracle降至90.25%——某些seeds的CLS/CWM errors更相关 （overlap更大），削弱complementarity； (2) 8B oracle升至93.10%，因为8B models各自更强（fewer errors）但complementarity pattern保持——CLS-only(4.5%) > CWM-only(2.1%)说明CWM的8B improvement 更多来自修正CWM-specific errors； (3) CLS FN dominance 75.5%和CWM FP dominance 83.1%在不同seeds间 保持稳定（±3pp），说明这是formulation-level的systematic pattern而非 random artifact——这是worst档pivot的strongest evidence； (4) Practical ensemble（simple voting而非oracle）只达到88.90%/91.20%， 低于oracle 1.73pp/1.90pp，说明error complementarity存在但 simple aggregation无法fully exploit它； (5) Kappa(correctness)在8B下降至0.65（vs 4B的0.73），说明8B models 的errors更diverse——更多potential for complementarity但也更难aggregate。\\nWorst档叙事：error complementarity是最robust的finding，不受 cls-vs-cwm accuracy comparison结果的影响。即使CLS≈CWM in accuracy， 它们的failure modes仍systematically不同，这本身就是有价值的characterization。\\n\"\n685\t  },\n686\t  {\n687\t    \"name\": \"Efficiency Equivalence Analysis\",\n688\t    \"description\": \"CLS (1-token) vs CWM (N-token) 的inference cost对比。 已有CPU数据（3.1x token overhead, 1.09x latency）， 预测GPU场景和repo-level scaling。\\n\",\n689\t    \"results\": {\n690\t      \"func_level_cpu\": {\n691\t        \"cls_output_tokens_mean\": 2.0,\n692\t        \"cwm_output_tokens_mean\": 6.2,\n693\t        \"token_ratio\": 3.1,\n694\t        \"latency_ratio\": 1.09,\n695\t        \"throughput_ratio\": 0.92\n696\t      },\n697\t      \"func_level_gpu\": {\n698\t        \"cls_latency_ms\": 45,\n699\t        \"cwm_latency_ms\": 85,\n700\t        \"latency_ratio\": 1.89,\n701\t        \"cls_throughput_sps\": 22.2,\n702\t        \"cwm_throughput_sps\": 11.8,\n703\t        \"throughput_ratio\": 1.88\n704\t      },\n705\t      \"repo_level_gpu\": {\n706\t        \"cls_output_tokens\": 2,\n707\t        \"cwm_output_tokens_mean\": 45,\n708\t        \"cwm_output_tokens_p95\": 180,\n709\t        \"token_ratio\": 22.5,\n710\t        \"cls_latency_ms\": 320,\n711\t        \"cwm_latency_ms\": 2800,\n712\t        \"latency_ratio\": 8.75,\n713\t        \"cls_throughput_sps\": 3.1,\n714\t        \"cwm_throughput_sps\": 0.36,\n715\t        \"throughput_ratio\": 8.6\n716\t      },\n717\t      \"batch_inference_1000_instances\": {\n718\t        \"cls_total_time_min\": 5.4,\n719\t        \"cwm_total_time_min\": 46.3,\n720\t        \"speedup\": 8.6\n721\t      },\n722\t      \"cost_per_1000_instances_a100\": {\n723\t        \"cls_cost_usd\": 0.05,\n724\t        \"cwm_cost_usd\": 0.43,\n725\t        \"cost_ratio\": 8.6\n726\t      }\n727\t    },\n728\t    \"tables\": [\n729\t      {\n730\t        \"caption\": \"Inference cost comparison: CLS vs CWM\",\n731\t        \"columns\": [\n732\t          \"Setting\",\n733\t          \"CLS Latency\",\n734\t          \"CWM Latency\",\n735\t          \"Speedup\",\n736\t          \"Accuracy Gap\"\n737\t        ],\n738\t        \"rows\": [\n739\t          [\n740\t            \"Func-level CPU\",\n741\t            \"9.76s\",\n742\t            \"10.61s\",\n743\t            \"1.09×\",\n744\t            \"~0pp\"\n745\t          ],\n746\t          [\n747\t            \"Func-level GPU\",\n748\t            \"45ms\",\n749\t            \"85ms\",\n750\t            \"1.89×\",\n751\t            \"~1.25pp\"\n752\t          ],\n753\t          [\n754\t            \"Repo-level GPU\",\n755\t            \"320ms\",\n756\t            \"2.8s\",\n757\t            \"8.75×\",\n758\t            \"~4.38pp\"\n759\t          ]\n760\t        ]\n761\t      },\n762\t      {\n763\t        \"caption\": \"Cost projection: 1000-instance verification (A100)\",\n764\t        \"columns\": [\n765\t          \"Method\",\n766\t          \"Time (min)\",\n767\t          \"Cost (USD)\",\n768\t          \"Accuracy (%)\"\n769\t        ],\n770\t        \"rows\": [\n771\t          [\n772\t            \"CLS (repo)\",\n773\t            5.4,\n774\t            \"$0.05\",\n775\t            79.88\n776\t          ],\n777\t          [\n778\t            \"CWM tok-2048 (repo)\",\n779\t            46.3,\n780\t            \"$0.43\",\n781\t            75.5\n782\t          ],\n783\t          [\n784\t            \"CWM tok-512 (repo)\",\n785\t            12.1,\n786\t            \"$0.11\",\n787\t            72.5\n788\t          ]\n789\t        ]\n790\t      }\n791\t    ],\n792\t    \"figures\": [],\n793\t    \"analysis\": \"Efficiency是worst档中唯一的\\\"clear win\\\" for CLS——但只在repo-level显著。 Pareto frontier图将是论文的key figure之一：CLS dominates at every cost level。 但reviewer可能要求CWM with unlimited tokens作为accuracy upper bound， 如果CWM with sufficient tokens matches CLS accuracy，efficiency argument reduces to \\\"same accuracy, lower cost\\\"——这是less exciting但still valid contribution。\\n\\nEfficiency equivalence是worst档pivot的angle之一：\\\"CLS用1-token output 达到CWM N-token相同accuracy，inference cost降低\\\"。\\n已有CPU数据显示仅1.09x latency差异，因为prefill dominates——但这 低估了real-world GPU差异： (1) Function-level GPU：prefill仍dominates但per-token decode在GPU上 更parallel-efficient，CWM的6.2 mean output tokens导致1.89x latency—— 比CPU的1.09x更明显但仍不dramatic，因为function-level outputs很短； (2) Repo-level GPU：CWM output tokens mean=45 (p95=180)，latency ratio 升至8.75x——这是efficiency argument的sweet spot； (3) 但worst档下accuracy comparison存疑（CLS 79.88% vs CWM ~75.50%@tok2048）， reviewer会说\\\"efficiency comparison only meaningful at accuracy parity\\\"； (4) Batch inference场景：1000 instances处理时间CLS 5.4min vs CWM 46.3min， 8.6x speedup——在best-of-N verification pipeline中（K=16 candidates ×  T=15 tests = 240 predictions per instance），CLS的low latency is genuinely  valuable for interactive repair workflows。\\nWorst档影响：efficiency argument在function-level很弱（1.09-1.89x）， 只在repo-level显著（8.75x）。但repo-level accuracy不足使得efficiency claim变为\\\"faster at a task it doesn't do well at\\\"——需要careful framing。\\n\"\n794\t  }\n795\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9c8b16a8-33d8-4f2a-9bff-decd99357cc2","uuid":"3dd036fb-4292-42e1-88fe-3f98233e27a5","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:14:11.387Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073712/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Diagnostic Re-repair Experiment\",\n    \"description\": \"给修复代理提供per-test failure predictions vs 无per-test信息， 在200个instances上比较resolve rate。使用SWE-agent框架， classification模型提供per-test诊断。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"baseline_resolve_rate_pct\": 29.0,\n      \"with_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pct\": 29.5,\n      \"resolve_rate_gain_pp\": 0.5,\n      \"gain_significant_at_005\": false,\n      \"mcnemar_p_value\": 0.72,\n      \"instances_helped_by_diagnostic\": 5,\n      \"instances_hurt_by_diagnostic\": 4,\n      \"net_helped\": 1,\n      \"diagnostic_precision_on_helped\": 0.8,\n      \"diagnostic_precision_on_hurt\": 0.6,\n      \"oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pct\": 33.5,\n      \"oracle_vs_baseline_gain_pp\": 4.5,\n      \"oracle_vs_predicted_gap_pp\": 4.0,\n      \"time_cost_per_instance_baseline_min\": 8.2,\n      \"time_cost_per_instance_diagnostic_min\": 8.5,\n      \"T1_instances_in_200\": 137,\n      \"T1_gain_pp\": 0.0,\n      \"T2plus_instances_in_200\": 63,\n      \"T2plus_gain_pp\": 1.6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Diagnostic re-repair: predicted vs oracle per-test information\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Resolve Rate (%)\",\n          \"Δ vs Baseline (pp)\",\n          \"p-value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"No diagnostic (baseline)\",\n            29.0,\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Predicted per-test diagnostic\",\n            29.5,\n            \"+0.5\",\n            \"0.72\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Oracle per-test (ceiling)\",\n            33.5,\n            \"+4.5\",\n            \"0.02\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Re-repair gain stratified by F2P test count\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"T bucket\",\n          \"N instances\",\n          \"Baseline resolve %\",\n          \"Diagnostic resolve %\",\n          \"Δ pp\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"T=1\",\n            137,\n            30.7,\n            30.7,\n            \"0.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T=2\",\n            40,\n            25.0,\n            27.5,\n            \"+2.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T≥3\",\n            23,\n            21.7,\n            21.7,\n            \"0.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"All\",\n            200,\n            29.0,\n            29.5,\n            \"+0.5\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Oracle ceiling（+4.5pp）与predicted gain（+0.5pp）之间的巨大gap（4.0pp） 证实了worst档的核心论断：per-test诊断的价值是真实的但目前prediction quality 不足以释放这个价值。在pivot论文中，这成为\\\"future work\\\"的明确方向—— 提升per-test prediction precision到>90%可能释放更多oracle ceiling。 但当前实验结论是negative：predicted diagnostics do not significantly  improve repair outcomes。\\n\\n\\nWorst档假设\\\"无downstream re-repair实验，per-test diagnostic value仅为theoretical  argument\\\"。即使勉强跑完实验，gain仅+0.5pp（29.5% vs 29.0%），原因： (1) 200个instances中~137个(68.7%)是T=1，per-test信息与trajectory-level数学等价， 诊断信号零增益； (2) 剩余63个T≥2 instances中，per-test prediction precision ~80%意味着每5个predicted-fail 中约1个是误报——修复代理基于错误诊断做了无效修复尝试（4个instances被误导）； (3) 仅5个instances中诊断真正帮助定位了具体失败测试并引导修复成功——但这些大多是 T=2且两个测试failure mode清晰分离的\\\"easy\\\"案例； (4) Oracle上界（33.5%）显示per-test信息在完美条件下有价值（+4.5pp），但predicted  diagnostic仅能实现11%的oracle ceiling（0.5/4.5）； (5) McNemar p=0.72，远不显著——200个instances的power不足以检测<1pp的差异。 这个结果在worst档叙事中将Claim 2完全降级为theoretical argument。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SWE-bench Per-Test Dataset Construction\",\n    \"description\": \"Docker重新评估SWE-bench Verified patches，提取per-test labels。 构建SWE-bench-PerTest数据集（500 instances × 16 candidates）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_instances_attempted\": 500,\n      \"successful_evaluations\": 458,\n      \"failed_docker_builds\": 27,\n      \"timeout_evaluations\": 15,\n      \"total_candidate_test_pairs\": 115872,\n      \"avg_tests_per_instance\": 15.8,\n      \"avg_f2p_tests_per_instance\": 2.1,\n      \"median_f2p_tests\": 1,\n      \"pct_T1_instances\": 71.2,\n      \"pct_T2_instances\": 16.8,\n      \"pct_T3plus_instances\": 12.0,\n      \"avg_p2p_tests_per_instance\": 13.7,\n      \"pass_rate_overall\": 0.73,\n      \"fail_rate_overall\": 0.27,\n      \"p2p_regression_rate\": 0.8,\n      \"construction_time_hours\": 24,\n      \"gold_patch_all_pass_rate\": 0.96,\n      \"candidate_diversity_unique_test_signatures\": 312\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"SWE-bench-PerTest dataset statistics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Instances (successful)\",\n            458\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Candidates per instance (mean)\",\n            16\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Total (code, test) pairs\",\n            \"115,872\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"F2P tests per instance (mean / median)\",\n            \"2.1 / 1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"P2P tests per instance (mean)\",\n            13.7\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T=1 instances\",\n            \"71.2%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"T≥2 instances\",\n            \"28.8%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Overall pass rate\",\n            \"73%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"P2P regression rate\",\n            \"0.8%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"F2P test count distribution\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"T\",\n          \"% Instances\",\n          \"Cumulative %\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            1,\n            71.2,\n            71.2\n          ],\n          [\n            2,\n            16.8,\n            88.0\n          ],\n          [\n            3,\n            5.2,\n            93.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4-5\",\n            3.8,\n            97.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"6+\",\n            3.0,\n            100.0\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"数据集本身作为resource contribution有独立价值。但worst档下的分布特征 系统性地削弱per-test方法的pitch：T=1主导+低regression rate意味着 大多数instances中per-test粒度退化为trajectory-level等价。 73%的pass rate使得\\\"预测fail\\\"成为稀有事件检测问题，precision-recall tradeoff更不利。论文需诚实报告这些分布特征并作为characterization贡献。\\n\\n\\n数据集构建是工程任务，worst档不影响技术成功率。但分布特征在worst档下 对论文叙事不利： (1) T=1占71.2%（高于function-level oracle sim的68.7%），意味着repo-level 数据中per-test粒度的理论优势更稀薄——超过7成instances只有1个F2P测试； (2) median F2P=1确认了T=1 mode的dominance； (3) P2P regression rate仅0.8%（远低于oracle sim中reg≥10%的threshold）， 意味着PASS_TO_PASS测试几乎不提供额外信号——patch极少破坏已通过的测试； (4) overall pass rate 73%意味着class imbalance加剧（vs function-level ~50:50）， majority baseline就有73%，fine-tuned模型需要beat这个high baseline； (5) 42/500 instances因Docker build failure或timeout丢失（8.4%）， 可能引入selection bias——失败的往往是环境最复杂的instances，恰恰是 per-test可能最有价值的instances。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DeepSeek-Coder CLS Function-Level\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32) 在function-level 数据上训练classification (pass/fail)。验证CLS formulation是否 architecture-independent。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"overall_accuracy\": 88.73,\n      \"pass_f1\": 88.85,\n      \"fail_f1\": 88.6,\n      \"pass_precision\": 90.5,\n      \"pass_recall\": 87.25,\n      \"fail_precision\": 87.0,\n      \"fail_recall\": 90.3,\n      \"train_loss\": 0.21,\n      \"eval_loss\": 0.075,\n      \"train_runtime_sec\": 4800,\n      \"unparseable\": 0,\n      \"cls_vs_cwm_gap_deepseek_pp\": 0.52,\n      \"cls_vs_cwm_gap_qwen4b_pp\": 1.25,\n      \"cls_vs_cwm_gap_qwen8b_pp\": 2.43,\n      \"gap_trend_with_size\": \"non-monotonic\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Cross-architecture CLS vs CWM comparison (function-level)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Architecture\",\n          \"Size\",\n          \"CLS Acc %\",\n          \"CWM Acc %\",\n          \"Gap (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3\",\n            \"4B\",\n            88.43,\n            87.19,\n            \"+1.25\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-Coder\",\n            \"6.7B\",\n            88.73,\n            88.21,\n            \"+0.52\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3\",\n            \"8B\",\n            89.4,\n            86.96,\n            \"+2.43\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek的小gap直接削弱了\\\"classification scales better with model size\\\"的claim。 在worst档pivot论文中，这变为characterization finding：\\\"CLS-CWM gap depends on  base model's code generation capability, not just formulation\\\"。 这实际上加强了complementarity角度——如果gap是architecture-dependent， 那么在不同模型上CLS和CWM的failure modes更可能不同，ensemble更有价值。\\n\\n\\nWorst档核心假设：\\\"DeepSeek实验显示不同pattern，削弱architecture-independence claim\\\"。 DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B是code-specialized模型（vs Qwen3通用模型），其预训练数据 包含大量代码执行trace，这使得CWM (generation)任务对DeepSeek相对更容易： (1) DeepSeek-CLS达到88.73%，介于Qwen-4B(88.43%)和Qwen-8B(89.40%)之间， 符合6.7B参数量的预期——这证明CLS在不同架构上表现一致； (2) 但CLS vs CWM gap仅0.52pp（远低于Qwen-4B的1.25pp和Qwen-8B的2.43pp）， 因为DeepSeek-Coder的code generation能力使CWM受益更多—— CWM在DeepSeek上达到~88.2%（vs Qwen-4B的87.19%）； (3) Gap trend变为non-monotonic：Qwen-4B 1.25pp → DeepSeek-6.7B 0.52pp →  Qwen-8B 2.43pp，无法claim \\\"gap随model size单调增长\\\"； (4) 这意味着CLS vs CWM gap不是architecture-independent的，而是依赖于 base model的code generation pretraining quality——pretraining越强的模型 CWM受益越多，gap越小。 Reviewer会据此质疑\\\"formulation advantage\\\"是否只是Qwen-specific artifact。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DeepSeek-Coder CWM Function-Level (seed default)\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA CWM generation baseline， function-level。已完成训练（eval_loss=0.04292），待测试集评估。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"overall_accuracy\": 88.21,\n      \"pass_f1\": 88.1,\n      \"fail_f1\": 88.32,\n      \"pass_precision\": 91.2,\n      \"pass_recall\": 85.2,\n      \"fail_precision\": 85.4,\n      \"fail_recall\": 91.4,\n      \"exact_match_rate\": 85.5,\n      \"train_loss_final\": 0.0986,\n      \"eval_loss\": 0.04292,\n      \"train_runtime_sec\": 5215,\n      \"unparseable\": 0,\n      \"vs_qwen4b_cwm_gap_pp\": 0.7,\n      \"vs_qwen8b_cwm_gap_pp\": 0.54\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"CWM generation accuracy across architectures\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Architecture\",\n          \"Size\",\n          \"CWM Acc %\",\n          \"Exact Match %\",\n          \"Eval Loss\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3\",\n            \"4B\",\n            87.51,\n            84.02,\n            0.064\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-Coder\",\n            \"6.7B\",\n            88.21,\n            85.5,\n            0.043\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3\",\n            \"8B\",\n            87.67,\n            84.39,\n            0.055\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek-CWM的优异表现是worst档的关键evidence：如果一个code-specialized 6.7B模型的CWM能match其CLS，那么CWM的\\\"difficulty\\\"不是generation task 的inherent property，而是base model capability的function。 论文pivot：不再claim \\\"generation is harder than classification\\\"， 改为\\\"the relative difficulty depends on the model's generation capability\\\"。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek-CWM在function-level达到88.21%，高于Qwen-4B CWM(87.51%)和 Qwen-8B CWM(87.67%)。原因： (1) DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B的eval_loss(0.043)显著低于Qwen-4B CWM(0.064)和 Qwen-8B CWM(0.055)，说明code-specialized pretraining让generation target 更容易拟合； (2) Exact match rate 85.5%（vs Qwen-4B的84.02%），更多predictions能 完美复现execution output字面值； (3) 这些output精确度的提升直接转化为分类准确率的提升——CWM的accuracy 上限受限于exact match quality； (4) 但与DeepSeek-CLS(88.73%)相比gap仅0.52pp，确认了在code-specialized 模型上classification advantage最小化。 Worst档叙事：DeepSeek的CWM强表现证明\\\"CWM failure modes at function-level\\\" 不是因为generation inherently harder，而是因为base model的generation  capability不同。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DeepSeek-Coder CWM Function-Level seed=123\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B CWM function-level with seed=123， 用于multi-seed validation of DeepSeek CWM results。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"overall_accuracy\": 87.88,\n      \"pass_f1\": 87.75,\n      \"fail_f1\": 88.0,\n      \"exact_match_rate\": 85.1,\n      \"eval_loss\": 0.0445,\n      \"train_runtime_sec\": 5300,\n      \"unparseable\": 0,\n      \"seed_default_accuracy\": 88.21,\n      \"seed_123_accuracy\": 87.88,\n      \"seed_gap_pp\": 0.33,\n      \"deepseek_cwm_mean_2seed\": 88.05,\n      \"deepseek_cwm_std_2seed\": 0.23\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"DeepSeek CWM multi-seed results (function-level)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Accuracy %\",\n          \"Exact Match %\",\n          \"Eval Loss\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"default\",\n            88.21,\n            85.5,\n            0.0429\n          ],\n          [\n            \"123\",\n            87.88,\n            85.1,\n            0.0445\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mean±Std\",\n            \"88.05±0.23\",\n            \"85.30±0.28\",\n            \"0.0437±0.001\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"两个seed结果一致但sample size不足。Worst档下reviewer会说 \\\"2 seeds is anecdotal, not statistical\\\"，要求至少3个seed。 如果deadline前无法补跑，DeepSeek comparison只能作为supplementary observation而非formal claim。\\n\\n\\nSeed=123与default seed的差异仅0.33pp（87.88% vs 88.21%），在正常 seed variance范围内（std ~0.23pp，低于Qwen-4B CWM的seed std ~0.35pp）。 DeepSeek-Coder的更低variance可能因为：(1) code-specialized pretraining提供了 更稳定的初始化，LoRA微调的随机性影响更小；(2) 6.7B参数量比4B有更多冗余， 对随机seed的敏感度更低。 两个seed的mean(88.05%)确认DeepSeek-CWM稳定优于Qwen-4B CWM(87.19%)， 但仅2个seed不足以做严格的statistical comparison。 Worst档影响：reviewer可能要求3-5个seed才接受architecture comparison claim， 仅2个seed被视为insufficient evidence。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DeepSeek-Coder CLS Repo-Level\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA classification在repo-level SWE-bench数据上训练。验证repo-level CLS是否generalize across architectures。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"best_checkpoint_accuracy\": 78.15,\n      \"best_checkpoint_f1_macro\": 69.82,\n      \"best_checkpoint_fail_f1\": 55.3,\n      \"best_checkpoint_pass_f1\": 84.34,\n      \"fail_precision\": 72.5,\n      \"fail_recall\": 44.6,\n      \"pass_precision\": 79.8,\n      \"pass_recall\": 89.5,\n      \"unparseable_pct\": 1.8,\n      \"majority_baseline\": 72.96,\n      \"gap_vs_majority_pp\": 5.19,\n      \"vs_qwen4b_repo_cls_accuracy_diff_pp\": -4.2,\n      \"vs_qwen8b_repo_cls_accuracy_diff_pp\": -5.37,\n      \"overfitting_epoch\": 2,\n      \"eval_loss_trend\": \"U-shaped, minimum at step 400-600\",\n      \"train_time_sec\": 18000\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Repo-level CLS across architectures\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Architecture\",\n          \"Size\",\n          \"Accuracy %\",\n          \"Fail F1 %\",\n          \"Gap vs Majority (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3\",\n            \"4B\",\n            82.35,\n            60.87,\n            \"+9.39\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-Coder\",\n            \"6.7B\",\n            78.15,\n            55.3,\n            \"+5.19\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3\",\n            \"8B\",\n            83.52,\n            65.85,\n            \"+10.56\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Function-to-repo performance drop by architecture\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Architecture\",\n          \"Func Acc %\",\n          \"Repo Acc %\",\n          \"Drop (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-4B\",\n            88.43,\n            82.35,\n            \"-6.08\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n            88.73,\n            78.15,\n            \"-10.58\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            89.4,\n            83.52,\n            \"-5.88\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek在repo-level的相对劣势是worst档最damaging的finding之一。 它证明：(a) CLS formulation的effectiveness是architecture-dependent； (b) code-specialized pretraining不自动转化为repo-level verification能力； (c) 不同架构在function-level vs repo-level的ranking反转（DeepSeek func >  Qwen-4B func, 但DeepSeek repo < Qwen-4B repo）。 论文必须降级architecture comparison为\\\"preliminary observation\\\"， 承认需要更多架构（CodeLlama, StarCoder等）才能draw conclusions。\\n\\n\\nWorst档核心假设：\\\"Repo-level CLS accuracy <80%或seed间variance>5pp\\\"。 DeepSeek-CLS-repo达到78.15%（低于Qwen-4B的82.35%和Qwen-8B的83.52%）， 原因： (1) DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B虽然是code-specialized模型，但其pretraining 偏向code generation而非code understanding/classification——repo-level 的pass/fail判断需要理解长上下文中的语义一致性，这是code understanding任务； (2) Repo-level input长度（5120-8192 tokens）对6.7B模型的attention capacity 构成挑战——DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B的有效context window可能不如Qwen3-8B； (3) LoRA rank=16可能对6.7B模型insufficient——Qwen实验中同样rank=16， 但Qwen3架构可能更LoRA-friendly（GQA vs MHA差异）； (4) 78.15%仅比majority baseline(73%)高5pp，在worst档范围[75,80]中部， reviewer会质疑这个marginal improvement是否justify the fine-tuning cost； (5) fail_f1仅55.30%，说明模型在识别failing tests方面表现差——这正是 per-test verification最需要的能力。\\n关键影响：DeepSeek在repo-level表现更差（vs function-level的88.73%）， drop幅度10.58pp（vs Qwen-4B的5.72pp from 88.43→82.35），说明 DeepSeek在domain transfer (func→repo) 上比Qwen更脆弱。 这进一步复杂化了architecture comparison story——不同架构在不同 complexity level上的ranking不同。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Repo-Level CLS Multi-Seed Validation\",\n    \"description\": \"Repo-level CLS的multi-seed validation（seed42已完成，预测seed123/456结果）。 验证repo-level结果的稳定性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed42_accuracy\": 82.35,\n      \"seed42_fail_f1\": 60.87,\n      \"seed123_accuracy\": 77.8,\n      \"seed123_fail_f1\": 53.2,\n      \"seed456_accuracy\": 79.5,\n      \"seed456_fail_f1\": 57.4,\n      \"multiseed_mean_accuracy\": 79.88,\n      \"multiseed_std_accuracy\": 2.32,\n      \"multiseed_mean_fail_f1\": 57.16,\n      \"multiseed_std_fail_f1\": 3.87,\n      \"seed_range_accuracy_pp\": 4.55,\n      \"seed42_vs_mean_diff_pp\": 2.47,\n      \"cls_vs_cwm_repo_gap_pp\": \"undefined (CWM repo failed)\",\n      \"reviewer_concern_seed_variance\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Repo-level CLS multi-seed results (Qwen3-4B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Seed\",\n          \"Accuracy %\",\n          \"Fail F1 %\",\n          \"Pass F1 %\",\n          \"Unparseable %\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            42,\n            82.35,\n            60.87,\n            89.59,\n            0.0\n          ],\n          [\n            123,\n            77.8,\n            53.2,\n            85.1,\n            1.5\n          ],\n          [\n            456,\n            79.5,\n            57.4,\n            87.3,\n            0.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mean±Std\",\n            \"79.88±2.32\",\n            \"57.16±3.87\",\n            \"87.33±2.25\",\n            \"0.77±0.75\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Multi-seed mean 79.88%低于majority baseline+10pp threshold that reviewers typically expect for \\\"meaningful\\\" improvement。Seed42的82.35%看起来decent 但它是3个seed中最好的——如果论文只报告seed42，reviewer会质疑cherry-picking。 报告3-seed mean则只有79.88%，不足以支撑strong repo-level claim。 Fail_f1的高variance（std 3.87pp）意味着per-test diagnostic在不同 random runs间不稳定——这与function-level（fail_f1 std ~0.92pp）形成鲜明对比。 在worst档pivot中，repo-level results降级为\\\"preliminary\\\"， 承认需要更多compute和hyperparameter tuning。\\n\\n\\nWorst档核心指标：repo_cls_accuracy_multiseed在[75,80]，repo_cls_fail_f1在[50,62]。 Seed42的82.35%是cherry-picked best seed： (1) Seed123在repo-level的home server上已有partial results——cls4b-seed123-ckpt800 val5120准确率87.92%（validation），但test准确率仅75.33%（大幅val-test gap， 9784 samples），说明该seed严重过拟合； (2) Seed456预计79.50%——居中但低于seed42，因为不同random initialization 在repo-level的高维parameter space中找到不同local minima； (3) Multi-seed mean 79.88%落入worst档[75,80]范围，std 2.32pp表示 moderate但不negligible的variance； (4) Seed42比mean高2.47pp，reviewer会质疑是否report了best seed； (5) Fail_f1 mean仅57.16%（std 3.87pp），说明模型对failing tests的识别 在不同seed间极不稳定——这是diagnostic value的致命缺陷； (6) CWM repo-level实验全部failed（unparseable 53-93%），无法计算cls-cwm gap， reviewer会归因于experimental design而非formulation差异。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Repo-Level CWM Revisited (Reviewer Challenge)\",\n    \"description\": \"预测reviewer对repo-level CWM失败的质疑及重做实验的结果。 Reviewer会认为CWM failure是max_new_tokens/prompt设计导致， 要求增大token budget重做。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"cwm_v10_accuracy\": 69.91,\n      \"cwm_v10_unparseable_pct\": 93.0,\n      \"cwm_v10_with_tok512_accuracy\": 72.5,\n      \"cwm_v10_with_tok512_unparseable_pct\": 45.0,\n      \"cwm_v10_with_tok1024_accuracy\": 74.8,\n      \"cwm_v10_with_tok1024_unparseable_pct\": 28.0,\n      \"cwm_v10_with_tok2048_accuracy\": 75.5,\n      \"cwm_v10_with_tok2048_unparseable_pct\": 18.0,\n      \"cwm_tok2048_vs_cls_gap_pp\": -4.38,\n      \"cwm_tok2048_inference_cost_ratio\": 35.0,\n      \"reviewer_satisfied\": false,\n      \"rebuttal_risk\": \"high\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Repo-level CWM accuracy vs token budget (Qwen3-4B)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"max_new_tokens\",\n          \"Accuracy %\",\n          \"Unparseable %\",\n          \"Δ vs CLS mean (pp)\",\n          \"Inference Cost (×)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            64,\n            69.91,\n            93.0,\n            \"-9.97\",\n            \"1.5×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            512,\n            72.5,\n            45.0,\n            \"-7.38\",\n            \"8×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            1024,\n            74.8,\n            28.0,\n            \"-5.08\",\n            \"16×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            2048,\n            75.5,\n            18.0,\n            \"-4.38\",\n            \"35×\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLS (1 token)\",\n            79.88,\n            0.0,\n            \"—\",\n            \"1×\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Token budget sweep是worst档rebuttal的核心风险。即使CWM-tok2048的accuracy 仍低于CLS，4.38pp gap在reviewer眼中可能\\\"来自其他confounds而非formulation\\\"。 在pivot论文中，这变为efficiency-accuracy tradeoff analysis： CLS用1-token达到CWM 2048-token的更高accuracy——这是genuine contribution 但需要careful framing避免being dismissed as \\\"unfair comparison\\\"。\\n\\n\\nWorst档假设：\\\"Reviewer将CWM repo-level failure归因于max_new_tokens/prompt设计， 要求重做实验\\\"。实际已有的cwm-v10结果：accuracy 69.91%但93%unparseable。 Reviewer的合理质疑： (1) max_new_tokens=64（D047记录）导致93% unparseable——这是obvious  experimental error，不是formulation的inherent limitation； (2) 增大token budget到512后unparseable降至~45%，accuracy升至72.50%—— 说明CWM failure是token budget artifact而非fundamental； (3) 进一步增至1024 (28% unparseable, 74.80%) 和2048 (18%, 75.50%)， CWM持续改善，但改善速度递减（diminishing returns）； (4) 即使tok=2048，CWM仍低于CLS mean(79.88%) 约4.38pp——但这个gap 可能是因为CWM还可以进一步优化（prompt format、更大token budget、 post-processing）； (5) Reviewer会说：\\\"You set up CWM to fail by limiting tokens.  A fair comparison needs CWM with sufficient token budget.\\\"—— 即使我们argue CWM的高token cost是formulation的inherent cost， reviewer关心的是accuracy comparison是否fair，not cost。\\nCWM-tok2048的35x inference cost是efficiency argument的支撑， 但worst档下reviewer可能不买账：\\\"efficiency without accuracy parity  is not a contribution\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Error Complementarity Deep Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"CLS和CWM在matched seeds上的error overlap分析。 已有4B seed42数据（oracle 90.63%），预测8B和multi-seed结果。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"oracle_ensemble_4b_seed42\": 90.63,\n      \"oracle_ensemble_4b_5seed_mean\": 90.25,\n      \"oracle_ensemble_8b_seed42\": 93.1,\n      \"oracle_ensemble_8b_3seed_mean\": 92.5,\n      \"cls_only_correct_pct_4b\": 3.12,\n      \"cwm_only_correct_pct_4b\": 2.8,\n      \"both_wrong_pct_4b\": 9.37,\n      \"cls_only_correct_pct_8b\": 4.5,\n      \"cwm_only_correct_pct_8b\": 2.1,\n      \"both_wrong_pct_8b\": 4.4,\n      \"cls_fn_dominance_pct\": 75.5,\n      \"cwm_fp_dominance_pct\": 83.1,\n      \"kappa_predictions_4b\": 0.88,\n      \"kappa_correctness_4b\": 0.73,\n      \"kappa_predictions_8b\": 0.82,\n      \"kappa_correctness_8b\": 0.65,\n      \"practical_ensemble_accuracy_4b\": 88.9,\n      \"practical_ensemble_accuracy_8b\": 91.2,\n      \"ensemble_vs_oracle_gap_4b_pp\": 1.73,\n      \"ensemble_vs_oracle_gap_8b_pp\": 1.9\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Error overlap analysis (function-level, matched seeds)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Category\",\n          \"4B seed42 (%)\",\n          \"4B 5-seed mean (%)\",\n          \"8B 3-seed mean (%)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Both correct\",\n            84.71,\n            84.35,\n            89.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLS-only correct\",\n            3.12,\n            2.95,\n            4.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM-only correct\",\n            2.8,\n            2.65,\n            2.1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Both wrong\",\n            9.37,\n            10.05,\n            4.4\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Oracle ensemble\",\n            90.63,\n            90.25,\n            93.1\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Error type asymmetry (CLS vs CWM)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Error Type\",\n          \"CLS (%)\",\n          \"CWM (%)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"False Negative (miss bug)\",\n            75.5,\n            16.9\n          ],\n          [\n            \"False Positive (false alarm)\",\n            24.5,\n            83.1\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Error complementarity在worst档下是最defensible的contribution。 它不依赖于CLS > CWM的claim——即使CLS ≈ CWM，它们fail on different  instances in predictable ways (CLS: conservative → miss bugs;  CWM: noisy generation → false alarms)。Oracle ensemble 90.63% 作为upper bound motivates future work on learned ensemble strategies。 在pivot论文中，这可以成为Section 5: \\\"Complementary Failure Modes  as a Verification Strategy\\\"的核心内容。\\n\\n\\nError complementarity是worst档pivot叙事的三大支柱之一。 4B seed42的已有数据：oracle 90.63%（both correct 84.71%, CLS-only 3.12%,  CWM-only 2.80%, both wrong 9.37%）。\\nWorst档下的补充预测： (1) 4B 5-seed mean oracle降至90.25%——某些seeds的CLS/CWM errors更相关 （overlap更大），削弱complementarity； (2) 8B oracle升至93.10%，因为8B models各自更强（fewer errors）但complementarity pattern保持——CLS-only(4.5%) > CWM-only(2.1%)说明CWM的8B improvement 更多来自修正CWM-specific errors； (3) CLS FN dominance 75.5%和CWM FP dominance 83.1%在不同seeds间 保持稳定（±3pp），说明这是formulation-level的systematic pattern而非 random artifact——这是worst档pivot的strongest evidence； (4) Practical ensemble（simple voting而非oracle）只达到88.90%/91.20%， 低于oracle 1.73pp/1.90pp，说明error complementarity存在但 simple aggregation无法fully exploit它； (5) Kappa(correctness)在8B下降至0.65（vs 4B的0.73），说明8B models 的errors更diverse——更多potential for complementarity但也更难aggregate。\\nWorst档叙事：error complementarity是最robust的finding，不受 cls-vs-cwm accuracy comparison结果的影响。即使CLS≈CWM in accuracy， 它们的failure modes仍systematically不同，这本身就是有价值的characterization。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Efficiency Equivalence Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"CLS (1-token) vs CWM (N-token) 的inference cost对比。 已有CPU数据（3.1x token overhead, 1.09x latency）， 预测GPU场景和repo-level scaling。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"func_level_cpu\": {\n        \"cls_output_tokens_mean\": 2.0,\n        \"cwm_output_tokens_mean\": 6.2,\n        \"token_ratio\": 3.1,\n        \"latency_ratio\": 1.09,\n        \"throughput_ratio\": 0.92\n      },\n      \"func_level_gpu\": {\n        \"cls_latency_ms\": 45,\n        \"cwm_latency_ms\": 85,\n        \"latency_ratio\": 1.89,\n        \"cls_throughput_sps\": 22.2,\n        \"cwm_throughput_sps\": 11.8,\n        \"throughput_ratio\": 1.88\n      },\n      \"repo_level_gpu\": {\n        \"cls_output_tokens\": 2,\n        \"cwm_output_tokens_mean\": 45,\n        \"cwm_output_tokens_p95\": 180,\n        \"token_ratio\": 22.5,\n        \"cls_latency_ms\": 320,\n        \"cwm_latency_ms\": 2800,\n        \"latency_ratio\": 8.75,\n        \"cls_throughput_sps\": 3.1,\n        \"cwm_throughput_sps\": 0.36,\n        \"throughput_ratio\": 8.6\n      },\n      \"batch_inference_1000_instances\": {\n        \"cls_total_time_min\": 5.4,\n        \"cwm_total_time_min\": 46.3,\n        \"speedup\": 8.6\n      },\n      \"cost_per_1000_instances_a100\": {\n        \"cls_cost_usd\": 0.05,\n        \"cwm_cost_usd\": 0.43,\n        \"cost_ratio\": 8.6\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Inference cost comparison: CLS vs CWM\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Setting\",\n          \"CLS Latency\",\n          \"CWM Latency\",\n          \"Speedup\",\n          \"Accuracy Gap\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Func-level CPU\",\n            \"9.76s\",\n            \"10.61s\",\n            \"1.09×\",\n            \"~0pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Func-level GPU\",\n            \"45ms\",\n            \"85ms\",\n            \"1.89×\",\n            \"~1.25pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Repo-level GPU\",\n            \"320ms\",\n            \"2.8s\",\n            \"8.75×\",\n            \"~4.38pp\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Cost projection: 1000-instance verification (A100)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Time (min)\",\n          \"Cost (USD)\",\n          \"Accuracy (%)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"CLS (repo)\",\n            5.4,\n            \"$0.05\",\n            79.88\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM tok-2048 (repo)\",\n            46.3,\n            \"$0.43\",\n            75.5\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CWM tok-512 (repo)\",\n            12.1,\n            \"$0.11\",\n            72.5\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Efficiency是worst档中唯一的\\\"clear win\\\" for CLS——但只在repo-level显著。 Pareto frontier图将是论文的key figure之一：CLS dominates at every cost level。 但reviewer可能要求CWM with unlimited tokens作为accuracy upper bound， 如果CWM with sufficient tokens matches CLS accuracy，efficiency argument reduces to \\\"same accuracy, lower cost\\\"——这是less exciting但still valid contribution。\\n\\nEfficiency equivalence是worst档pivot的angle之一：\\\"CLS用1-token output 达到CWM N-token相同accuracy，inference cost降低\\\"。\\n已有CPU数据显示仅1.09x latency差异，因为prefill dominates——但这 低估了real-world GPU差异： (1) Function-level GPU：prefill仍dominates但per-token decode在GPU上 更parallel-efficient，CWM的6.2 mean output tokens导致1.89x latency—— 比CPU的1.09x更明显但仍不dramatic，因为function-level outputs很短； (2) Repo-level GPU：CWM output tokens mean=45 (p95=180)，latency ratio 升至8.75x——这是efficiency argument的sweet spot； (3) 但worst档下accuracy comparison存疑（CLS 79.88% vs CWM ~75.50%@tok2048）， reviewer会说\\\"efficiency comparison only meaningful at accuracy parity\\\"； (4) Batch inference场景：1000 instances处理时间CLS 5.4min vs CWM 46.3min， 8.6x speedup——在best-of-N verification pipeline中（K=16 candidates ×  T=15 tests = 240 predictions per instance），CLS的low latency is genuinely  valuable for interactive repair workflows。\\nWorst档影响：efficiency argument在function-level很弱（1.09-1.89x）， 只在repo-level显著（8.75x）。但repo-level accuracy不足使得efficiency claim变为\\\"faster at a task it doesn't do well at\\\"——需要careful framing。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":795,"startLine":1,"totalLines":795}}}
